# NOC JWT and ownership integration -- manual checks only; nothing was executed.
# Refresh Maven dependencies and restart NOC Service + Gateway yourself.
# Set JWT_SECRET in NOC to the exact existing Auth/Gateway signing secret (>=32 bytes).
# Existing DB configuration and NOC schema are still required. If columns/tables
# are missing, run ../db/migrate-noc-service.sql manually as the schema owner first.
# Optional local profile uses the same authentication as every other profile.
# Do not send officerId/actorId query parameters; these cannot change token identity.
#
# POLICY:
# BORROWER: own-loan reads/download/history/verification only.
# LOAN_CLOSURE_OFFICER / ADMIN: reads + generation/reissue/retry.
# COLLATERAL_OFFICER: read-only, including certificate download/verification.
# GRIEVANCE_OFFICER / unknown role: denied.
# Database borrower/officer account must be ACTIVE, and officer role must still match.
# Officer managing their own linked loan: 403.
# Reads against another borrower's loan/certificate: 404; no document/audit write.
#
# MANUAL NEGATIVE CHECKS:
# Missing/expired/modified/wrong-issuer JWT -> 401 at gateway and directly on 8088.
# BORROWER token on generation/reissue/retry -> 403 even with ?officerId=2101.
# Borrower B cannot get/list/download/verify/history/eligibility for Borrower A.
# COLLATERAL_OFFICER cannot generate/reissue/retry; GRIEVANCE_OFFICER cannot read.
# Disabled officer or changed DB role -> 403; inactive borrower cannot read.
# Signed token with no exp, nonpositive/nonintegral userId or mismatched subject denied.
# Repeat each request directly on port 8088: gateway bypass must not bypass checks.
# Verify NOC.ISSUED_BY and NOC_AUDIT.ACTOR_ID match JWT userId, never query values.
# Failed access must not create a PDF/NOC/audit row. Existing eligibility still requires
# CLOSED loan, zero outstanding, and closure date; active loans cannot get a certificate.

@base = http://localhost:8080
@direct = http://localhost:8088
@borrowerToken = REPLACE_WITH_BORROWER_TOKEN
@officerToken = REPLACE_WITH_LOAN_CLOSURE_OFFICER_TOKEN
@loanId = REPLACE_WITH_OWNED_CLOSED_LOAN_ID
@nocId = REPLACE_WITH_OWNED_NOC_ID
@certificateNumber = REPLACE_WITH_OWNED_CERTIFICATE_NUMBER

### Owning borrower: eligibility
GET {{base}}/api/noc/eligibility/{{loanId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{borrowerToken}}

### Loan closure officer: generate (no officerId parameter)
POST {{base}}/api/noc/generate/{{loanId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{officerToken}}

### Owning borrower: list
GET {{base}}/api/noc/loan/{{loanId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{borrowerToken}}

### Owning borrower: details
GET {{base}}/api/noc/{{nocId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{borrowerToken}}

### Owning borrower: verify
GET {{base}}/api/noc/verify/{{certificateNumber}}
Authorization: Bearer {{borrowerToken}}

### Owning borrower: download (no actorId parameter)
GET {{base}}/api/noc/{{nocId}}/download
Authorization: Bearer {{borrowerToken}}

### Owning borrower: history
GET {{base}}/api/noc/{{nocId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{borrowerToken}}

### Officer: reissue
POST {{base}}/api/noc/reissue/{{loanId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{officerToken}}

### Officer: retry a failed/delayed certificate
POST {{base}}/api/noc/{{nocId}}/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{officerToken}}

### Direct port must reject anonymous access, including local profile
GET {{direct}}/api/noc/{{nocId}}

### Borrower must not access mutations or impersonate an officer
POST {{direct}}/api/noc/generate/{{loanId}}?officerId=2101
Authorization: Bearer {{borrowerToken}}
